{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-011", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "European solar startups raise €82 million in January-August", "content": "<p>Analysis by Avnet Silica says energy security remains the most significant driver of investment in European solar startups today as financing levels begin to increase after reaching an all-time low last year.   </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/european-solar-startups-raise-e82-million-in-january-august/\">European solar startups raise €82 million in January-August</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/european-solar-startups-raise-e82-million-in-january-august/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-012", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -1.0, "keywords": ["loss"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Acid-free molten salt method recovers 94% of silver from solar cells", "content": "<p>Researchers in China have recovered 94.34% of the silver from crystalline silicon solar cells using an acid-free molten salt process that detaches the silver as metal, and have identified how to control silicon loss during treatment.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/acid-free-molten-salt-method-recovers-94-of-silver-from-solar-cells/\">Acid-free molten salt method recovers 94% of silver from solar cells</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/acid-free-molten-salt-method-recovers-94-of-silver-from-solar-cells/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-013", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Togo opens consultation on large-scale solar tender", "content": "<p>Togo is inviting stakeholders to provide feedback on draft documents relating to development of a large-scale solar project, ahead of launching a competitive tender. Comments can be submitted until November 9.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/togo-opens-consultation-on-large-scale-solar-tender/\">Togo opens consultation on large-scale solar tender</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/togo-opens-consultation-on-large-scale-solar-tender/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-014", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -1.0, "keywords": ["loss"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "New flywheel design could eliminate power converter for grid connection", "content": "<p>A research team has built a fixed-speed flywheel prototype that uses a wire-rope mechanism to move weights inward and outward during discharge and charge. The system briefly supplied power to the electrical supply, but steady-state losses prevented net electrical energy discharge over the complete operation.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/new-flywheel-design-could-eliminate-power-converter-for-grid-connection/\">New flywheel design could eliminate power convert", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/new-flywheel-design-could-eliminate-power-converter-for-grid-connection/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-015", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["installation_demand", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Sunkean advances copper-to-aluminum jumpers for PV DC systems", "content": "<p>The manufacturer has developed a copper-to-aluminum jumper solution for PV DC-side applications, addressing conductor material costs, field installation efficiency, and the long-term reliability of copper-to-aluminum connections in utility-scale solar projects.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/sunkean-advances-copper-to-aluminum-jumpers-for-pv-dc-systems/\">Sunkean advances copper-to-aluminum jumpers for PV DC systems</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/sunkean-advances-copper-to-aluminum-jumpers-for-pv-dc-systems/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-016", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Qvantum launches 50 kW propane heat pump for residential, commercial applications", "content": "<p>The Swedish heat pump manufacturer said its the QA50 heat pump delivers a maximum heating capacity of 50 kW and a COP of up to 3.12. The system uses propane (R290) as a refrigerant, operates at outdoor temperatures ranging from -25 C to 43 C, and can be integrated into low-temperature ambient heat networks.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/qvantum-launches-50-kw-propane-heat-pump-for-residential-commercial-applications/\">Qvantum launches 50 kW propane heat pump ", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/qvantum-launches-50-kw-propane-heat-pump-for-residential-commercial-applications/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-017", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "New coating technology could reduce glass usage in photovoltaic modules by up to 40%", "content": "<p>German startup Exxosqel has developed a coating technology that strengthens solar glass by targeting microscopic surface cracks. Developed in collaboration with the Fraunhofer Institute for Silicate Research, the technology could reduce glass weight by up to 40% and overall PV module weight by approximately 30%.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/new-coating-technology-could-reduce-glass-usage-in-photovoltaic-modules-by-up-to-40/\">New coating technology could redu", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/28/new-coating-technology-could-reduce-glass-usage-in-photovoltaic-modules-by-up-to-40/", "type": "rss"}]}
